(kicad_sch
	(version 20260306)
	(generator "eeschema")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(uuid "1fe809f7-eb04-4a49-9f66-d15ed27639bb")
	(paper "A2" portrait)
	(title_block
		(title "AART Slot Car Braking Module")
		(date "2026-06-19")
		(rev "11")
		(company "AART - Adrian & Richard's Technologies")
		(comment 1 "TOP LEVEL — double-click a sheet symbol to open it")
		(comment 2 "STM32G051K6U6 QFN-32 | libopencm3 | Revision 11 | DAC1 brake + PWM anti-brake current source, TPS1212-Q1 reverse switch")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "- Reverse-block pass element = two N-ch (Q5/Q6, common-source) + U5 TPS1212-Q1\n  driven from WHITE (VS, not anode). RSNS current sense; I_DIR reverse (~6-10us) +\n  I2t OCP + 5us SCP + IMON/FLT. Sits in BLACK CONTROLLER path. ~67-77mV at 40A (with RSNS).\n- BLACK sense (PA1) is on the TRACK side of the pass switch.\n- D1 TVS is on the WHITE rail only (transient clamp).\n- Anti-brake = constant-CURRENT source (Q1 TIP147 + GD1 HV op-amp + Rsense 0.1ohm). GD1 is\n  powered from the WHITE rail (~16V), NOT +5V (it senses at ~16V common mode). 50kHz PWM\n  demand (level-shift + RC filter) sets current: 0 = off, full = 3A. Bounded at stall.\n- Brake (Q2 IRFP250N) is resistance-controlled, linear, no PWM. Both Q1 and Q2\n  dissipate 10-15W linear and REQUIRE heatsinks.\n- PA4 DAC1 = brake (linear). PA5 PWM = anti-brake current demand (50kHz, filtered).\n- Retired & must NOT be fitted: TIM3 PWM, UCC27524 drivers, IRF9Z34N P-ch +\n  floating supply (ZD1/R_Z1/C_Z1/LM321), IRLB3034, LTC4412 pass gate, capture button,\n  LTC7001/INA241/comparator (now TPS1212-Q1), TIP122 voltage follower (now TIP147 current source)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 169.672 253.936 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1ff9b0a3-9ea5-45b7-9970-47e092360e97")
	)
	(text "FETs / power devices\nQ2  IRFP250N   TO-247  Wide-SOA N-ch brake FET (30A 200V) + HEATSINK\nQ1  TIP147     TO-220  PNP Darlington anti-brake current-source pass (100V 10A 125W) + HEATSINK\n   (alt: N-MOSFET SUP70060E / RFP50N06 / FDP61N20)\nRsense 0.1ohm 1-2W  anti-brake current sense (0.3V at 3A)\nQ_LS 2N2222  PWM level-shift   C_KA 470n + R 10k/1k  PWM->DC demand filter\nQ5  STL059N4S8AG PowerFLAT  Reverse-block N-ch (40V 0.59mohm)\nQ6  STL059N4S8AG PowerFLAT  Reverse-block N-ch (common-source with Q5)\n   (alt Q5/Q6: Vishay SiJK140E 0.34mohm)\nDiodes\nD1  P6KE18CA  SMB  TVS bidirectional (WHITE rail clamp; CA essential)\nD2  SS310     SMB  Q2 catch diode (100V)\nD4  MBRS360   SMB  Anti-brake follower reverse block (emitter -> track)\nRSNS ~0.5-0.75mohm  TPS1212 main-path current sense (CS1+/CS1-)\nCI2t/CTMR/RIOC  TPS1212 I2t breaker time, retry timer, OCP threshold\nD5  LED Red   0805  Status LED (PB6)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 282.448 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "2d492aa6-df6f-4ac8-bcaa-f3257fb583af")
	)
	(text "ICs\nU1  STM32G051K6U6  QFN-32    MCU (dual DAC, libopencm3, FW Rev 11)\nU2  AMS1117-3.3 / MCP1700  SOT-223/23  LDO 12-16V -> 3.3V (see 7A.6)\nU4  MCP1700-5002   SOT-23   LDO 12-16V -> 5V rail (GD2 brake buffer only; GD1 on WHITE)\nGD2 op-amp buffer  SOT-23-5  Brake gate buffer (DAC1 -> Q2, linear)\nGD1 HV op-amp     SOT-23-5  Anti-brake CURRENT-SOURCE loop on WHITE rail (PWM demand -> Q1; Rsense 0.1ohm)\nU5  TPS1212-Q1     VQFN-23  Smart high-side switch controller for Q5/Q6 (VS from WHITE):\n    reverse block (I_DIR) + I2t OCP + 5us SCP + IMON/FLT. RSNS ~0.5-0.75mohm sense.\n    (replaces LTC7001+INA241+comparator; TI vs ADI; adds protection)\nU3  CH340N         SOP-8    USB-UART bridge"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.114 255.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "55f6e959-ddf0-40ac-9ba2-2ea6bdd9453e")
	)
	(text "Passives\nF1  500mA-1A polyfuse 1812  WHITE rail MCU/analog supply ONLY (never BLACK)\nR2  10k 0402  GD2 input safe-default pull-up\nR3  10R 0402  Q2 gate    R_BASE 1k 0402  Q1 Darlington base\nRsense 0.1ohm  anti-brake current sense   RSNS ~0.5-0.75mohm  TPS1212 main-path sense\nQ_LS 2N2222  PWM level-shift   C_KA 470n + R 10k/1k  PWM->DC filter\nR8  15k / R9 4k7  WHITE sense divider (PA0)\nR10 22k / R11 4k7 BLACK sense divider (PA1, track side of switch)\nR5  10k  Pot ref to 3.3V    R12 330R  Status LED\nC1-C7 decoupling (LDO rails + MCU VDD/VDDA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.608 310.642 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9ddb6005-3240-480d-a2a7-e0fe9cd26816")
	)
